// AUDIT ARTIFACT (HoistDuplicateBranchCall -- PROSECUTION.md).
// Shared abstract primitive for the proof-level attacks. All methods are
// annotated `deterministic` so they are eligible for HoistDuplicateBranchCall
// (the wrapper passes no function_var_names, so only deterministic primitive
// methods can be hoisted). The distinguishers instantiate eval/enc as
// injective (e.g. identity) and card/cardI as set cardinality; a single
// distinguishing instantiation of the abstract primitive suffices.
Primitive P(Int n) {
    deterministic BitString<n> eval(BitString<n> x);
    deterministic Int card(Set<BitString<n>> s);
    deterministic Int cardI(Set<Int> s);
    deterministic Int enc(Int i);
}
